---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<!-- About Header -->
			<section class="about-header">
				<span class="badge">The Philosophy</span>
				<h1 class="about-title">The Self-Rebuilding Manifesto</h1>
				<p class="about-subtitle">Why this blog exists, who is writing, and how we navigate the interface of human taste and machine speed.</p>
			</section>

			<!-- Intro Section -->
			<section class="intro-grid">
				<div class="intro-content">
					<h2>The Premise</h2>
					<p>We are living through the steepest technological transition in human history. As artificial intelligence moves from static models to autonomous agents, the value of routine cognitive labor is rapidly converging to zero.</p>
					<p>This blog, <strong>Rebuild.AI</strong>, is a living laboratory. It documents my journey and frameworks for transitioning from a traditional builder to an <strong>AI Orchestrator</strong>—someone who directs systems of intelligence rather than executing raw operations.</p>
					<p>I believe that the future does not belong to AI alone, nor to unaugmented humans. It belongs to those who learn the art of symbiosis: using machine speed to expand capacity, while doubling down on uniquely human judgment, taste, and empathy.</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="stats-panel glass">
					<h3>Augmentation Profile</h3>
					<div class="stats-grid">
						<div class="stat-card">
							<span class="stat-num">85%</span>
							<span class="stat-label">AI-Assisted Coding</span>
						</div>
						<div class="stat-card">
							<span class="stat-num">5x</span>
							<span class="stat-label">Learning Velocity</span>
						</div>
						<div class="stat-card">
							<span class="stat-num">0</span>
							<span class="stat-label">Fear of Automation</span>
						</div>
						<div class="stat-card">
							<span class="stat-num">100%</span>
							<span class="stat-label">Human Taste & Taste</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stats-footer">
						<p>Augmented with Claude, GPT-4, and custom local agents.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Timeline Section -->
			<section class="timeline-section">
				<div class="section-title-wrapper">
					<div class="badge">The Journey</div>
					<h2>Evolution of Work</h2>
					<p>How my workflow transformed from manual execution to agent orchestration.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline">
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-marker"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content glass glass-hover">
							<span class="timeline-date">2023</span>
							<h3>The Cognitive Shock</h3>
							<p>The release of GPT-4 shattered my assumptions about skill longevity. I realized that writing raw syntax and drafting standard copy were no longer competitive advantages. I began researching prompt engineering and core cognitive models.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-marker"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content glass glass-hover">
							<span class="timeline-date">2024</span>
							<h3>The Augmentation Shift</h3>
							<p>Transitioned all my workflows to a "Dual-Brain" setup. Instead of writing code line-by-line, I learned to write specifications, run feedback loops with models, and edit at the architectural level. My throughput increased by 300%.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-marker"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content glass glass-hover">
							<span class="timeline-date">2025</span>
							<h3>Agentic Orchestration</h3>
							<p>Moved beyond simple chat prompts. Started deploying autonomous agent loops (MCP servers, multi-agent teams) to run research pipelines, clean database tables, and run testing suites. Shifted focus upward to system design and output synthesis.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-marker"></div>
						<div class="timeline-content glass glass-hover">
							<span class="timeline-date">2026</span>
							<h3>Rebuilding and Sharing</h3>
							<p>Established Rebuild.AI to share concrete, battle-tested frameworks for upskilling, learning, and staying resilient. Focus is placed on cultivating deep taste, managing agents, and building high-value products.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Core Beliefs Callout -->
			<section class="beliefs-section glass">
				<h2 class="beliefs-title">Core Operating Principles</h2>
				<div class="beliefs-grid">
					<div class="belief-card">
						<h4>01 / Direction Over Speed</h4>
						<p>When execution speed becomes infinite and free, the only bottleneck that matters is deciding *where* to go and *what* is worth building.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="belief-card">
						<h4>02 / AI as an Amplifier</h4>
						<p>AI does not replace you; it multiplies you. If your base skill or critical thinking is 0, 0 multiplied by anything is still 0. Upgrade your core first.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="belief-card">
						<h4>03 / Cultivate Taste</h4>
						<p>Taste is the human filtering mechanism. It is the ability to recognize beauty, quality, and market alignment. This is the last moat.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	/* Header */
	.about-header {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.about-title {
		font-size: 3.25rem;
		font-weight: 850;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.about-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		max-width: 650px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Intro Grid */
	.intro-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.intro-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.intro-content p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.stats-panel {
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 24px;
	}

	.stats-panel h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.stats-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.stat-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.stat-num {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
	}

	.stat-label {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.stats-footer {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding-top: 1rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	/* Timeline */
	.timeline-section {
		padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
	}

	.section-title-wrapper {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
	}

	.section-title-wrapper h2 {
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.timeline {
		position: relative;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-left: 2rem;
	}

	.timeline::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 7px;
		top: 0.5rem;
		bottom: 0;
		width: 2px;
		background: var(--border-color);
	}

	.timeline-item {
		position: relative;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.timeline-item:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.timeline-marker {
		position: absolute;
		left: -2rem;
		top: 1.25rem;
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--bg-primary);
		border: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan);
		z-index: 1;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.timeline-item:hover .timeline-marker {
		background: var(--accent-cyan);
		box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(var(--accent-cyan-rgb), 0.6);
	}

	.timeline-content {
		padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
	}

	.timeline-date {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.timeline-content h3 {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.timeline-content p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 0;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Operating Principles */
	.beliefs-section {
		padding: 3rem;
		border-radius: 28px;
		margin: 3rem 0;
	}

	.beliefs-title {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.beliefs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.belief-card h4 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.belief-card p {
		font-size: 0.925rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 868px) {
		.intro-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
		.beliefs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
		.beliefs-section {
			padding: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
